        "answer": {
          "short": "$99x=12$, so $x=\\frac{4}{33}$.",
          "worked": "$$\\begin{align*}100x-x&=12.121212\\ldots-0.121212\\ldots\\\\99x&=12\\\\x&=\\frac{12}{99}\\\\x&=\\frac{4}{33}\\end{align*}$$",
